# Upstream ignores the generated parser (src/parser.c, src/tree_sitter/,
# grammar.json, node-types.json) because its main branch regenerates it.
# This branch COMMITS the generated sources of the 0.7.3 release asset
# (ABI 15), so those rules are dropped here -- see PREBUILD.md.
node_modules
*.swp
/build
/prebuilds
*.tgz
Cargo.lock
/target/*
*.a
*.dylib
*.so
*.o
bindings/c/*.h
bindings/c/tree-sitter-*.pc
.vscode/
/.build
